  "root_scoring_details": "The task requires integer IDs. The formatter rounds values before its allowed-ID test and checks shape only when the input exists; it does not compare affines. The scorer rounds combined outputs, fuses available private class masks at >0.5 with higher IDs winning overlap, and includes every foreground class with both-empty Dice 1. A missing class file contributes no foreground if another class exists. Absent/unreadable pairs are skipped; shape-error pairs contribute zero and count as completed. Aggregate scales per-class and macro means by completed-pair fraction and combines workflow and clinical scores equally; medal uses unscaled macro Dice."
